{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1192782-bio-vitakinesis-question","id":1192782,"title":"Bio & Vitakinesis question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-07T14:52:01-08:00","id":1192782,"title":"Bio & Vitakinesis question","content":"So The first part of this would be, can a bio or vita use their modes to purge excess quantity of biological matter that interferes with operations? i.e. could they counter a massive dose of potassium or an injection of insulin? <br /> <br /> If so<br /> <br /> As this can be \u201ctoxic\u201d to the body, could they purge the toxins that build up causing fatigue resulting in extended physical activity as well as reduced or eliminated need for sleep?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-07T15:23:45-08:00","id":1192800,"title":"","content":"Both Accelerate and Metabolic control would (IMO) allow for it. Accelerate, under Vitakinesis even mentions it.<br /> <br /> It seems to me that either would reduce the amount of time needed to deal with the issue. You may never have sleep down to 0 but you could cut the need by days.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1383-yrtalien","name":"yrtalien","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-07T16:24:18-08:00","id":1192839,"title":"","content":"Sorry for asking a question inside a thread that's already asking a question, but, this made me curious how vitakinesis interacts with non-human living organisms. It makes sense that it might be able to enhance animals, but how about microscopic organisms? Could a vitakinetic manipulate the noetic template of a single virus to create an especially potent strain? Could they manipulate yeast or plants to create especially nourishing food just before baking or harvest?<br /> <br /> It seems like Augendis might be able to cover this sort of thing in theory, even if the mechanics are (understandably) focused on how psionic powers are useful in an action adventure scenario rather than psychic farming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23646-goblinsociety","name":"GoblinSociety","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-08T09:41:24-08:00","id":1193174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GoblinSociety</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1192782-bio-vitakinesis-question?p=1192839#post1192839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for asking a question inside a thread that's already asking a question, but, this made me curious how vitakinesis interacts with non-human living organisms. It makes sense that it might be able to enhance animals, but how about microscopic organisms? Could a vitakinetic manipulate the noetic template of a single virus to create an especially potent strain? Could they manipulate yeast or plants to create especially nourishing food just before baking or harvest?<br /> <br /> It seems like Augendis might be able to cover this sort of thing in theory, even if the mechanics are (understandably) focused on how psionic powers are useful in an action adventure scenario rather than psychic farming.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love it. A possible psi-hating vitakinetic creates a suite of organisms that can detect (by way of attraction), neutralize (by disrupting connection to psi) or wholesale terminate (by seeking out only individuals with a particular connection to psi [or quantum or whatever we're calling the ability of the inspired]) the sub-species. Wow. Totally could be an interesting way to branch your timeline or just create a really deep, action-packed long-term campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7165-queen-anne-country","name":"Queen Anne Country","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-08T15:45:01-08:00","id":1193336,"title":"","content":"In my most longbrunning aberrant game (still going on now for 10+ years) one of my characters with Biomanipulation used organisms he created to terraform a planet. He also created a host of micro life able to use quantum energies to simulate quantum powers. From there he also used bio manipulation and consciousness supremacy to create a hive mind to a living super organism so the planet was self aware. He imbedded a control gene to allow the microbes to bond and respond to certain people to replicate magic the best he could. <br /> Then of course the planet became obsessed with him and he had to terminate the project. Thankfully planet 2.0 turned out much better after he learned from his mistakes!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}